@decision d/gb2dbe4820872-1 { status: cited, source: { kind: file, ref: crates/cargo-smysl-verdict/Cargo.toml@b2dbe4820872 }, "code:kind": act, "ingest:quote": "cargo-smysl-facts = { workspace = true }" }
~ Add `cargo-smysl-facts` as a dependency

To support the retrieval and matching of facts, which is part of the verdict stage.

@decision d/gb2dbe4820872-2 { status: cited, source: { kind: file, ref: crates/cargo-smysl-verdict/src/lib.rs@b2dbe4820872 }, "code:kind": act, "ingest:quote": pub mod matching; }
~ Add `matching` module to `lib.rs`

To handle the checking of one claim against the facts, as part of the matching process.

@decision d/gb2dbe4820872-3 { status: speculative, "code:kind": act, "ingest:quote": "[dependencies]\ncargo-smysl-facts = { workspace = true }\n\n[features]\ndefault = []\n# Hosted providers need TLS; the default build has no network stack at all, which is what the self-contained objective and the CI rule mean (D18).\nhosted = [\"cargo-smysl-extract/hosted\"]" }
~ Update `Cargo.toml` with new dependencies and features

To include necessary crates for the new functionality and to define features like `hosted` that require TLS.

@decision d/gb2dbe4820872-4 { status: speculative, "code:kind": act, "ingest:quote": "/// Check a recorded claim against the code, and say what may be concluded (D11, D12).\nEvidence { .. } => not_yet(\"evidence\", \"Phase 3 — verdicts and test evidence\")," }
~ Add `Evidence` command to `cli.rs`

To allow checking a recorded claim against the code and saying what may be concluded, as part of Phase 3.

@decision d/gb2dbe4820872-5 { status: cited, source: { kind: file, ref: crates/cargo-smysl-verdict/src/matching.rs@b2dbe4820872 }, "code:kind": act, "ingest:quote": "pub fn retrieve<'a>(claim: &str, facts: &'a [Fact], r: &Retrieval) -> Shown<'a> {" }
